<title>USA: World sunflowerseed production - USDA.</title>
<headline>World sunflowerseed production - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Agriculture Department world sunflowerseed crop estimates by countries and regions (million tonnes) --</p>
<p>    -		  1996/97		    1995/96</p>
<p>		   Oct 96   Sept 96	 Oct 96   Sept 96</p>
<p> World Total    23.72     23.43	  25.78     25.91</p>
<p>	  U.S.     1.53	1.50	   1.82	1.82</p>
<p>     Ex-USSR     5.71	5.71	   7.38	7.38</p>
<p>   Argentina     4.50	4.50	   5.60	5.60</p>
<p>	    EU     3.82	3.65	   3.23	3.23</p>
<p>    East Eur     3.16	3.01	   2.72	2.72</p>
